WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.556
"Oh no," thought Wukong. "Yellow Brows is coming!"

2
00:00:07.557 --> 00:00:12.386
The monkey jumped back to his feet and ran fast out of the monastery.

3
00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:16.283
When he got outside, everyone was waiting for him.

4
00:00:16.284 --> 00:00:19.966
"Where are the bags?" asked Wujing.

5
00:00:19.967 --> 00:00:22.384
[g@The monkey looked at his empty hands.

6
00:00:22.385 --> 00:00:23.860
He slapped his forehead.@g]

7
00:00:23.861 --> 00:00:26.159
"I must have dropped them."

8
00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:29.810
He heard footsteps approaching from inside the monastery.

9
00:00:29.811 --> 00:00:33.408
"We can't worry about the bags now," whispered Wukong.

10
00:00:33.409 --> 00:00:35.284
[g@"Yellow Brows is coming.

11
00:00:35.285 --> 00:00:39.539
We have to go—quickly!"@g]

12
00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:43.330
He helped the Tang Monk up onto the horse.

13
00:00:43.331 --> 00:00:51.863
The group hurried down the road.

14
00:00:51.864 --> 00:00:55.212
"Run faster, Bajie!" hissed Wujing.

15
00:00:55.213 --> 00:00:59.297
[g@Zhu Bajie breathed heavily.

16
00:00:59.298 --> 00:01:04.085
"I . . . don't . . . like . . . running!"@g]

17
00:01:04.086 --> 00:01:08.984
They hadn't gotten far before Yellow Brows flew over them.

18
00:01:08.985 --> 00:01:12.660
"You can't escape from me!" shouted the demon.

19
00:01:12.661 --> 00:01:15.654
"And you will not be going to the West.

20
00:01:15.655 --> 00:01:22.536
I am a true Buddhist, and I will be the one to get the True Scriptures!"

21
00:01:22.537 --> 00:01:26.855
Wukong, Bajie, and Wujing pulled out their weapons.

22
00:01:26.856 --> 00:01:33.989
The Gold Dragon bared its claws.

23
00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:35.586
[g@Yellow Brows scoffed.

24
00:01:35.587 --> 00:01:38.880
"Do you really think you can fight me?"@g]

25
00:01:38.881 --> 00:01:43.110
He reached into his robe and pulled out the cloth.

26
00:01:43.111 --> 00:01:46.694
Bajie lowered his rake and laughed.

27
00:01:46.695 --> 00:01:49.183
[g@"We have powerful weapons.

28
00:01:49.184 --> 00:01:52.421
And all you have is a piece of cloth!"@g]

29
00:01:52.422 --> 00:01:56.319
"That's not an ordinary cloth," warned the dragon.

30
00:01:56.320 --> 00:02:01.279
Yellow Brows threw the cloth toward the group.

31
00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:04.010
"Look out!" cried Wukong.

32
00:02:04.011 --> 00:02:09.123
The monkey leaped up to the sky just before the cloth wrapped around his companions.

33
00:02:09.124 --> 00:02:12.806
Quickly the demon grabbed the cloth, with the group in it.

34
00:02:12.807 --> 00:02:17.270
He ran back into his monastery and slammed the door shut.

35
00:02:17.271 --> 00:02:21.294
[g@Wukong sat down on a cloud to think.

36
00:02:21.295 --> 00:02:24.468
How could he rescue his companions?@g]

37
00:02:24.469 --> 00:02:28.230
"I can't ask the Jade Emperor for help," thought Wukong.

38
00:02:28.231 --> 00:02:32.637
"He already sent the Gold Dragon, who was just captured again.

39
00:02:32.638 --> 00:02:35.436
Maybe I can ask Guanyin for help."

40
00:02:35.437 --> 00:02:40.349
As Wukong was wondering what to do, two spirits approached him.

41
00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:43.927
One was a turtle, and the other was a serpent.

42
00:02:43.928 --> 00:02:48.245
The two spirits each carried a sword and a shield.

43
00:02:48.246 --> 00:02:52.041
[g@"We're from Wudang Mountain," said the turtle.

44
00:02:52.042 --> 00:02:54.924
"We've come to help you."@g]

45
00:02:54.925 --> 00:02:56.541
The serpent nodded.

46
00:02:56.542 --> 00:03:02.427
"We heard the Tang Monk was captured by a demon called Yellow Brows."

47
00:03:02.428 --> 00:03:05.393
"Thank you for coming," said Wukong.

48
00:03:05.394 --> 00:03:08.958
He quickly told them what had happened.

49
00:03:08.959 --> 00:03:12.500
"Let's go to the monastery now," said the turtle.

50
00:03:12.501 --> 00:03:16.584
"Yellow Brows won't be able to fight all three of us."

51
00:03:16.585 --> 00:03:20.533
"We are much too powerful for him," added the serpent.

52
00:03:20.534 --> 00:03:26.569
Wukong led the two spirits down to the monastery.

53
00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:30.655
"Just be careful of his cloth," warned the monkey.

54
00:03:30.656 --> 00:03:33.637
"He'll try to capture us with it."

55
00:03:33.638 --> 00:03:36.960
Wukong banged on the monastery door.

56
00:03:36.961 --> 00:03:40.694
"Release my friends right now, Yellow Brows!

57
00:03:40.695 --> 00:03:44.446
If you don't, I'll knock down your monastery!

58
00:03:44.447 --> 00:03:48.132
Then I'll smash your entire mountain!"

59
00:03:48.133 --> 00:03:50.294
[g@The door flew open.

60
00:03:50.295 --> 00:03:55.209
Yellow Brows stepped out and threw the cloth.@g]

61
00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:57.561
"Look out!" cried Wukong.

62
00:03:57.562 --> 00:04:02.224
The monkey jumped out of the way, but the turtle and serpent weren't fast enough.

63
00:04:02.225 --> 00:04:06.208
The cloth wrapped around them.

64
00:04:06.209 --> 00:04:11.783
Laughing, the demon grabbed the bundle and went back into the monastery.

65
00:04:11.784 --> 00:04:14.897
[g@Wukong flew back up into the sky.

66
00:04:14.898 --> 00:04:18.726
He sat on a cloud and moaned.@g]

67
00:04:18.727 --> 00:04:21.205
"Now what will I do?"

68
00:04:21.206 --> 00:04:26.426
He was still thinking when he heard a voice. "Hello, Wukong!"

69
00:04:26.427 --> 00:04:30.642
Wukong looked toward the voice and saw a man with a big belly.

70
00:04:30.643 --> 00:04:32.620
The man was smiling.

71
00:04:32.621 --> 00:04:35.623
"Do you know who I am?" asked the man.

72
00:04:35.624 --> 00:04:37.033
[g@Wukong smiled.

73
00:04:37.034 --> 00:04:39.724
"You're the buddha Maitreya."@g]

74
00:04:39.725 --> 00:04:47.400
"Yes," said Maitreya. "And I've come to help you."

